    "1ee105a9-3a66-4f20-bb66-2e42844ddace": {
      "start": 10795,
      "end": 11473,
      "txt": "Ele a viu. Ela era linda. Mas é como se ela viesse de uma outra época, de um outro lugar... Ele olhou de novo para tempestade porque estava ficando cada vez pior. E ele decidiu dar o fora dali.",
      "transcriptionText": "He sees her, she's beautiful. But like she's from some other time, some other place. He looks back at the weather, because it's getting worse and worse, and decides to hightail it out of there.",
      "characterId": "e1312a3b-38da-4fe8-a7e3-ca4068782b5a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [
          "Annotation.Context"
        ],
        "text": "Hightail it: leave quickly."
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "2891435d-2fc2-4ffe-b154-93047f72c7a8": {
      "start": 7183,
      "end": 7222,
      "txt": "O que ele disse?",
      "transcriptionText": "What did he say?",
      "characterId": "ff669043-0afa-4f1f-a750-d4d860556837",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "2b16d701-f800-434b-b7d0-3873bdfab6d6": {
      "start": 3331,
      "end": 3376,
      "txt": "Alguma ligação?",
      "transcriptionText": "Any connection? ",
      "characterId": "ff669043-0afa-4f1f-a750-d4d860556837",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "2de90846-667f-49fe-a452-9cb644dae02e": {
      "start": 6650,
      "end": 7124,
      "txt": "Chequei esse também, o cara parece um informante do inferno, e agora eu não sei no que acreditar... Só sei que não quero acreditar nele.",
      "transcriptionText": "I had him checked out too. Guy's a goddamn Eagle Scout. So now, now I don't know what to believe. I know I don't want to believe him.",
      "characterId": "e1312a3b-38da-4fe8-a7e3-ca4068782b5a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [
          "Annotation.Context"
        ],
        "text": "Eagle Scout: Eagle Scout is the highest rank attainable in the Scouts BSA program by the Boy Scouts of America. With this he is implying he is probably a reputable/good person."
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "304886dc-c03f-42f8-bcdf-16a82aca7c35": {
      "start": 12945,
      "end": 13015,
      "txt": "Sim, uma testemunha.",
      "transcriptionText": "Yeah, a witness.",
      "characterId": "e1312a3b-38da-4fe8-a7e3-ca4068782b5a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "3246bc05-8588-440e-b5f3-7a776d0727aa": {
      "start": 20326,
      "end": 20398,
      "txt": "Ainda está aí, capitão.",
      "transcriptionText": "Are you still there, Captain?",
      "characterId": "cfb935d6-3a44-45f2-8f22-91396c80397a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
    "33a8b1ca-a188-420c-90ff-3d11313f052f": {
      "start": 5530,
      "end": 5702,
      "txt": "Bom, pra começar, não tinha corpos e...",
      "transcriptionText": "Well, for one thing, there's no bodies and...",
      "characterId": "e1312a3b-38da-4fe8-a7e3-ca4068782b5a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
