    "4344dff7-0a80-4aee-b32a-0f6b02a286b2": {
      "start": 7232,
      "end": 8162,
      "txt": "Ele disse que estava passeando com o cachorro nos penhascos a cima do El Matador, sabe? E ele olhou pra praia, onde fica a pedra enorme, aquele que é separada do continente, onde o mar encontra a areia. Ele disse: \"Parecia uma criatura marinha mítica, ou coisa assim.\"",
      "transcriptionText": "He said he was out there walking his dog along the bluffs above El Matador, right? And he looks down at the beach at that huge rock, you know, the one that's separated from the mainland, right where the ocean meets the shore. His words, looks like a, like a \"mythic sea creature.\" You know that one?",
      "characterId": "e1312a3b-38da-4fe8-a7e3-ca4068782b5a",
      "segments": [],
      "aux": {},
      "dubAnnotations": {
        "types": [],
        "text": ""
      },
      "styles": [],
      "transcriptionStyles": [],
      "transcriptionRubies": {},
      "onScreen": "OFF_ON",
      "tag": {
        "on": false,
        "color": "#CCCCCC",
        "text": ""
      },
      "voice": {
        "spans": [],
        "tags": {}
      },
      "rubies": {},
      "type": ""
    },
